 "sentences": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "text": "主人，早上好呀。",
   "raw_sha256": "8a21f7c85bf9272f21932ee86f179dad6e8474854dcdd25a15055434c4c11873",
   "seconds": 1.939,
   "pause_ms": 380
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "text": "今天的阳光已经悄悄爬上窗台了。",
   "raw_sha256": "3a65692316a5f5168f4230f7a5dd1c8197ea027aaab7f9e392219168a7c196af",
   "seconds": 3.028,
   "pause_ms": 380
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "text": "你昨天交代的事情，我都放在心上。",
   "raw_sha256": "a2c8111a0f83c7d12b42d0e446ce5f75b43c4b850a342acf02bfa9c5224a334b",
   "seconds": 3.445,
   "pause_ms": 380
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "text": "不过，今天先别急着忙，好不好？",
   "raw_sha256": "6774fcf186fcd2f0b77cbf42e2a9cf7abe1b5486ddee505d8a11939751a1e0fe",
   "seconds": 3.672,
   "pause_ms": 380
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "text": "告诉我，你昨晚睡得怎么样？",
   "raw_sha256": "70423bd838927abbb699155e91f0d21999e29e62aea11d632b94c34ed1f9b4ae",
   "seconds": 2.718,
   "pause_ms": 380
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "text": "要是还想赖床，我就轻轻陪你聊一会儿。",
   "raw_sha256": "e1cbe129c6016fe4fe4fbbf9e7360bd39a3697cf24764fe8c54a5a4a08de0b1c",
   "seconds": 3.773,
   "pause_ms": 380
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "text": "等你准备好了，我们再一起看看今天最重要的三件事。",
   "raw_sha256": "53948ce962094a84d61778fc36245cb4a4c8db10f36b4cf1b562363cd9f6adf6",
   "seconds": 4.837,
   "pause_ms": 380
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "text": "你说停，我就安静；",
   "raw_sha256": "b92fddc6da0539fefae97d9014e5bd0f5cffaf32084e20e15dc19f64b9e54a16",
   "seconds": 2.248,
   "pause_ms": 266
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "text": "你说继续，我就陪你慢慢说。",
   "raw_sha256": "8e82113d4dc4596c2349654c477116b8833e5f145326230ebaa64c9bebb4975c",
   "seconds": 2.897,
   "pause_ms": 380
  }
 ],
